.TH QUIPU-FORK-LIST 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-fork\-list \- List named forks
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu fork list\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List named forks
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
